  "question": "Can 600 LLM-annotated spans distil into a deterministic encoder?",
  "task_form": "multi-label \u2014 four independent sigmoids with positive-class weighting, not a four-way softmax, because the dimensions co-occur (`no history of X` is both negated and historical).",
